  "notes": "USAGE: {予想|よそう} is commonly used to talk about predictions and expectations, especially regarding outcomes, results, or future events.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {予想|よそう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to expect, predict)\n- {予想|よそう}⟦{通|どお}り→どおり：09884_doori⟧ (as expected)\n- {予想|よそう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{超|こ}える→超える：01942_koeru⟧ (to exceed expectations)\n- {予想|よそう}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{反|はん}して→反する：11966_hansuru⟧ (contrary to expectations)\n- {予想|よそう}⟦{外|がい}→外〜：03948_gai⟧ (unexpected)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{予測|よそく}→予測：03665_yosoku⟧ - prediction, forecast (more analytical/scientific)\n- ⟦{予期|よき}→予期：03662_yoki⟧ - expectation, anticipation\n- ⟦{見込|みこ}み→見込み：06872_mikomi⟧ - prospect, expectation",
